MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7157304328841453087}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 29794f2ae98276e40945227668594762, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  gameController: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueList:
  - ID: 22000
    dialogue:
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Hello, I am god.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: Worshipper
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Fuck you god
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0.764151, g: 0.09011213, b: 0.09011213, a: 1}
      text: No, fuck you!
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
  - ID: 22001
    dialogue:
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Hey there!
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: The first thing you should know is how to use your cards.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: You have three types of cards.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0.98039216, g: 1, b: 0.2509804, a: 1}
      text: Yellow cards are towers. You can drag them to place down towers.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0.4856693, g: 0.40899786, b: 0.9528302, a: 1}
      text: 'Blue cards are spells. Like towers, you can drag them to use them. '
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0.8867924, g: 0.4224813, b: 0.4224813, a: 1}
      text: Red cards, however, are very special. They're artifacts! We will touch
        on that in a bit.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Try placing down a tower!
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
  - ID: 22002
    dialogue:
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: It's me, God, again!
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: By now, you've probably clicked on a tower, right?
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: You're probably wondering where the upgrade button is, right?
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Worry not! Through a mechanism called "Slotting," you can upgrade your
        towers!
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: What's slotting? You ask?
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Well, it's very simple. When you click on a tower, you'll see the targetting,
        stats, and even a trash button!
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Now, if you look at the very top, you'll see a shilouette resembling
        a card.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: If you a drag a card there, you can upgrade the tower.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: However! Not every card can be "Slotted." Only select cards can.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0.8862745, g: 0.42352942, b: 0.42352942, a: 1}
      text: Like I mentioned before, Artifacts are for this very purpose! You can
        slot them and it'll grant your tower special abilities, ranging from stat
        boosts to even making it really big.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0.98039216, g: 1, b: 0.2509804, a: 1}
      text: Similarly, towers can also be slotted. Be warned, they don't grant any
        abilities and can only give the "Stacked" tower half of their original stat.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0.4862745, g: 0.40784314, b: 0.9529412, a: 1}
      text: Spells, unfortuntely, can not be "Slotted."
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: That'll be all! Try it out if you have the necessary cards.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
  - ID: 22003
    dialogue:
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: So, you're probably thinking "What's this I'm seeing?"
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Worry not, for I, God, shall teach you again!
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: This, you see, is a shop. You can buy and sell your cards.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Be warned since not every shop offers the same price.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: If you don't like the cards or the prices, you can refresh the shop for
        the low LOW price of 1000.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: The prices, however, increases by 500 each time you refresh.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Mhm? Whose running the shop?
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Your's truly, of course! I, God, am running the shop.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Be sure to buy as much as you can afford!
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
  - ID: 22004
    dialogue:
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Woah! Did you see that boar?
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: It suddenly started charging, did it not?
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Well, just like how certain towers have abilities and artifacts can add
        abilities, so do the enemies.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: The boar, for instance, can charge every so often. Quite a simple ability
        if I do say so myself.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: God
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Watch out for different abilities! Some might even be... a game changer
        as one might say.
      image: {fileID: 0}
      imageSide: 0
  - ID: 22005
    dialogue:
    - name: Slime King
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Blub blub...
      image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f183fe8114ef26b40b528f73501c686c, type: 3}
      imageSide: 1
    - name: You
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: ...
      image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d4eb5dfd13cf6b44eb9db12225e49466, type: 3}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: Slime King
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Blub?
      image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f183fe8114ef26b40b528f73501c686c, type: 3}
      imageSide: 1
    - name: You
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: ........
      image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d4eb5dfd13cf6b44eb9db12225e49466, type: 3}
      imageSide: 0
    - name: Slime King
      textColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
      text: Blub blub! BLUB BLUB BLUB!!!!
      image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f183fe8114ef26b40b528f73501c686c, type: 3}
      imageSide: 1
  dialoguePrefab: {fileID: 4689816308881287988, guid: 2483f476f2534ae4f80a458007679cd5, type: 3}
  dialogueBackground:
  - {fileID: 431627265, guid: 8bf43f6737c3695499fe9714bd1b1a0f, type: 3}
